msgid "lightning storm"
msgstr "tormenta de relámpagos"

#. [unit_type], id=Dragon King, race=monster
#: A_Song_of_the_Winds/units/drakes/Dragon_King.cfg:4
msgid "Dragon King"
msgstr "Rey Dragón"

#. [unit_type], id=Dragon King, race=monster
#: A_Song_of_the_Winds/units/drakes/Dragon_King.cfg:23
msgid ""
"Dragons are proud creatures by nature, obeying nothing but their own whims. "
"However, legends tell of dragons so powerful that even other dragons humbled"
" themselves before him. It is a fortunate thing indeed that such 'Dragon "
"Kings' only live in the realm of legend - for if but one of them truly "
"existed, the unstoppable inferno he would unleash would end the world as we "
"know it."
msgstr ""
"Los dragones son criaturas orgullosas por naturaleza, que no obedecen más "
"que sus propios caprichos. Sin embargo, las leyendas hablan de dragones tan "
"poderosos que incluso otros dragones se humillaron ante él. Es una suerte "
"que tales «Reyes Dragón» solo existan en el reino de la leyenda… porque si "
"tan solo uno existiera de verdad, el infierno imparable que desataría "
"acabaría con el mundo tal como lo conocemos."

