#: A_Song_of_the_Winds/units/heroes/Deni_Pathfinder.cfg:5
msgid "female^Pathfinder"
msgstr "Guía"

#. [unit_type], id=Deni_Pathfinder, race=windsong, gender=female
#: A_Song_of_the_Winds/units/heroes/Deni_Pathfinder.cfg:19
msgid ""
"Capable of racing through the toughest terrain with uncanny speed, those "
"known as Pathfinders serve as the vanguards of the Windsong armies. They "
"have devoted themselves to developing their own agility, and long practice "
"has granted them an almost inhuman speed. And, when they deem it necessary, "
"their fluid grace and skill with their glaive allow them to strike like the "
"thunder they wield, catching distracted foes unawares."
msgstr ""
"Capaces de atravesar el terreno más difícil con una velocidad asombrosa, "
"aquellas conocidas como Guías sirven como la vanguardia de los ejércitos "
"Windsong. Se han dedicado a desarrollar su propia agilidad, y una larga "
"práctica les ha otorgado una velocidad casi inhumana. Y, cuando lo "
"consideran necesario, su gracia fluida y habilidad con la guja les permiten "
"golpear como el trueno que manejan, tomando desprevenidos a los enemigos "
"distraídos."

#. [attack], type=pierce, range=melee
#. [attack], type=blade, range=melee
