msgstr "Heraldo"

#. [unit_type], id=Herald_ASotW, race=windsong, gender=female
#. [unit_type], id=Herald_Maat, race=windsong, gender=female
#. [unit_type], id=Raika_Herald, race=windsong, gender=female
#: A_Song_of_the_Winds/units/heroes/Herald.cfg:23
#: A_Song_of_the_Winds/units/heroes/Maat_Herald.cfg:31
#: A_Song_of_the_Winds/units/heroes/Raika_Herald.cfg:23
msgid ""
"As children, Weavers learn to communicate with their accompanying spirit via a special type of cipher. The spirit will only ever respond to the girl it bound itself to, and has a very basic mind. As an Envoy, dealing with unexpected and often dangerous situations, she has learned how useful this spirit can be. Those who dedicate long hours to the understanding and training of their accompanying spirit gain a powerful ally who will guide their bow and empower their purges. Those who achieve this link join the elite ranks of the Heralds, responsible directly to the Council.\n"
"\n"
"Heralds can move instantly between areas of high cipher activity (friendly towns)."
msgstr ""
"De niñas, las Tejedoras aprenden a comunicarse con su espíritu acompañante a través de un tipo especial de cifrado. El espíritu solo responde a la niña a la que se unió, y tiene una mente muy básica. Como Enviada, enfrentándose a situaciones inesperadas y a menudo peligrosas, ha aprendido cuán útil puede ser este espíritu. Aquellas que dedican largas horas a comprender y entrenar a su espíritu acompañante ganan un poderoso aliado que guiará su arco y potenciará sus purgas. Quienes logran este vínculo se unen a las filas élite de los Heraldos, responsables directamente ante el Consejo.\n"
"\n"
"Los Heraldos pueden moverse instantáneamente entre áreas de alta actividad de cifrado (pueblos aliados)."

#. [unit_type], id=High Ascendant, race=windsong, gender=female
#: A_Song_of_the_Winds/units/heroes/High_Ascendant.cfg:5
msgid "female^High Ascendant"
msgstr "Ascendiente Suprema"

#. [unit_type], id=High Ascendant, race=windsong, gender=female
#. [unit_type], id=Worldsweave_Ascendant, race=windsong, gender=female
#: A_Song_of_the_Winds/units/heroes/High_Ascendant.cfg:27
#: A_Song_of_the_Winds/units/heroes/Worldsweave_Ascendant.cfg:28
msgid ""
"Windsong legends tell of weavers who are bound not to a single spirit, but to The Raw itself. As they grew up, quickly rising through the ranks of the Windsong, they reached pinnacles of power that other mortals could only dream of, becoming like goddesses amongst humans. They were given the title of 'High Ascendant', and their deeds and wisdom became the stuff of many a legend of the Windsong and even other people.\n"
"\n"
"Albeit peaceful in normal times, a High Ascendant who decides to unleash her full power is a terrifying sight, even for the mightiest beings."
msgstr ""
"Las leyendas de las Hijas del Viento hablan de tejedoras que no están ligadas a un solo espíritu, sino al Tejido mismo. A medida que crecían, ascendiendo rápidamente en las filas de las Hijas del Viento, alcanzaron cimas de poder con las que otros mortales solo podían soñar, convirtiéndose en diosas entre los humanos. Recibieron el título de «Ascendiente Suprema», y sus hazañas y sabiduría se convirtieron en material de numerosas leyendas entre las Hijas del Viento e incluso otros pueblos.\n"
"\n"
"Aunque pacíficas en tiempos normales, una Ascendiente Suprema que decide liberar todo su poder es un espectáculo aterrador, incluso para los seres más poderosos."

#. [attack], type=impact, range=melee
#. [attack], type=cold, range=melee
#: A_Song_of_the_Winds/units/heroes/High_Ascendant.cfg:55
