#. [unit_type], id=Sunna Sylph, race=elf, gender=female
#: A_Song_of_the_Winds/units/heroes/Sunna_Sylph.cfg:4
msgid "female^Solariel Sylph"
msgstr "Sílfo Solariel"

#. [unit_type], id=Sunna Sylph, race=elf, gender=female
#: A_Song_of_the_Winds/units/heroes/Sunna_Sylph.cfg:26
msgid ""
"Rarely seen, the sage-like Sylphs are masters of both their faerie and "
"mundane natures. They are possessed of wondrous, and sometimes terrifying "
"powers. Legends concerning these have given other races a healthy fear of "
"the elves."
msgstr ""
"Rara vez vistas, las sabias sílfides son maestras tanto de la naturaleza "
"feérica como de la naturaleza mundana. Poseen asombrosos y a veces "
"aterradores poderes. Las leyendas acerca de ellas han inspirado en otras "
"razas un sano temor hacia los elfos."

#. [unit_type], id=Worldsweave_Ascendant, race=windsong, gender=female
#: A_Song_of_the_Winds/units/heroes/Worldsweave_Ascendant.cfg:5
