msgid "Well of Memories"
msgstr "Pozo de los Recuerdos"

#. [unit_type], id=Well of Memories, race=mechanical
#: A_Song_of_the_Winds/units/miscelanea/Well_of_Memories.cfg:19
msgid ""
"The Well of Memories is a natural convergence that serves as focal point for"
" all of the Raw's streams that permeate Irdya. No one knows how it was "
"formed, but even the first Windsong knew its protection was essential for "
"the Raw's persistence on their world."
msgstr ""
"El Pozo de los Recuerdos es una convergencia natural que sirve como punto "
"focal para todos los flujos del Crudo que impregnan Irdya. Nadie sabe cómo "
"se formó, pero incluso las primeras Hijas del Viento sabían que su "
"protección era esencial para la persistencia del Crudo en su mundo."

