#. [unit_type], id=Elvish Ancestor, race=undead
#: A_Song_of_the_Winds/units/undead/Elvish_Spirit_Ancestor.cfg:5
msgid "Ancestor"
msgstr "Ancestro"

#. [unit_type], id=Elvish Ancestor, race=undead
#: A_Song_of_the_Winds/units/undead/Elvish_Spirit_Ancestor.cfg:28
msgid ""
"Revered warriors of old roam through the elven forests, visible only by the "
"light of their shining silver blades, their wounds having closed as if they "
"had never existed. Though they are only partially present in the mortal "
"realm, their voices can whisper words in the wind that chill the hearts of "
"their enemies, words that show the true meaning of fear."
msgstr ""
"Guerreros reverenciados de antaño vagan por los bosques élficos, visibles "
"solo por la luz de sus brillantes hojas plateadas, con sus heridas cerradas "
"como si nunca hubieran existido. Aunque solo están parcialmente presentes en"
" el reino mortal, sus voces pueden susurrar palabras en el viento que hielan"
" el corazón de sus enemigos, palabras que muestran el verdadero significado "
"del miedo."

#. [attack], type=arcane, range=melee
#: A_Song_of_the_Winds/units/undead/Elvish_Spirit_Ancestor.cfg:32
#: A_Song_of_the_Winds/units/undead/Elvish_Spirit_Forefather.cfg:33
#: A_Song_of_the_Winds/units/undead/Elvish_Spirit_Warrior.cfg:33
msgid "ancient blade"
msgstr "hoja antigua"

#. [attack], type=cold, range=ranged
#: A_Song_of_the_Winds/units/undead/Elvish_Spirit_Ancestor.cfg:44
#: A_Song_of_the_Winds/units/undead/Elvish_Spirit_Forefather.cfg:45
msgid "requiem"
msgstr "réquiem"

#. [unit_type], id=Elvish Forefather, race=undead
#: A_Song_of_the_Winds/units/undead/Elvish_Spirit_Forefather.cfg:5
msgid "Forefather"
msgstr "Antepasado"

#. [unit_type], id=Elvish Forefather, race=undead
#: A_Song_of_the_Winds/units/undead/Elvish_Spirit_Forefather.cfg:29
msgid ""
"The ancient elvish lords may come back to this world in times of great need,"
" to lead their people to glory once again. When attacking, they sing a "
"chilling chant of death, one which can paralyze their opponents with shear "
"fear. This has been known to have changed the course of many a battle in "
"favor of the elven forces, even when defeat was so close at hand."
msgstr ""
"Los antiguos señores élficos pueden regresar a este mundo en tiempos de gran"
" necesidad para liderar nuevamente a su pueblo hacia la gloria. Al atacar, "
"entonan un canto escalofriante de muerte que puede paralizar a sus oponentes"
" con puro terror. Se sabe que esto ha cambiado el curso de muchas batallas a"
" favor de las fuerzas élficas, incluso cuando la derrota parecía inminente."

#. [unit_type], id=Elvish Warrior Spirit, race=undead
#: A_Song_of_the_Winds/units/undead/Elvish_Spirit_Warrior.cfg:5
msgid "Warrior Spirit"
msgstr "Espíritu Guerrero"

#. [unit_type], id=Elvish Warrior Spirit, race=undead
#: A_Song_of_the_Winds/units/undead/Elvish_Spirit_Warrior.cfg:29
msgid ""
"The greatest elvish warriors of times past are not completely gone, for they"
" consider even death no obstacle to them. They will roam the forests which "
"formerly served as their homes, wandering through both their memories and "
"the mortal plane of which they inhabit. Their recollections of glorious "
"battles and wars, conquests and defeats, cause them to eternally seek a "
"chance to perform those same feats once again. Indeed, this is not "
"difficult, for they can strike the utmost terror into their foes, sometimes "
"even causing death."
msgstr ""
"Los más grandes guerreros élficos del pasado no han desaparecido por "
"completo, pues consideran incluso a la muerte como ningún obstáculo. "
"Vagabundean por los bosques que alguna vez fueron sus hogares, recorriendo "
"tanto sus recuerdos como el plano mortal que habitan. Sus recuerdos de "
"batallas y guerras gloriosas, conquistas y derrotas, los llevan a buscar "
"eternamente una oportunidad para realizar esas mismas hazañas una vez más. "
"De hecho, no es difícil, pues pueden infundir el terror más absoluto en sus "
"enemigos, a veces incluso causando la muerte."

