#. [heals], id=healing
#: A_Song_of_the_Winds/utils/asotw-abilities.cfg:12
msgid ""
"Allows the unit to heal adjacent allied units at the beginning of our turn.\n"
"\n"
"A unit cared for by this healer may heal up to 6 HP per turn, or stop poison from taking effect for that turn.\n"
"This ability will not cure an affected unit of poison, however, only delay its effect."
msgstr ""
"Permite a la unidad sanar a unidades aliadas adyacentes al comienzo de nuestro turno.\n"
"\n"
"Una unidad atendida por esta sanadora puede recuperar hasta 6 PV por turno, o impedir que el veneno haga efecto en ese turno.\n"
"Esta habilidad no cura el veneno de una unidad afectada, solo retrasa su efecto."

